			title: "&5&lApothic Mastery: Beyond Vanilla Limits",
			description: [
				"&7Because you carry one single &eSacred Armor & Tool Line&7 throughout the entire pack, &5Apothic Enchanting&7, &6Apotheosis Gems/Affixes&7, and &4Apothic Spawners&7 are the primary way to scale your combat power against 2x-boosted Dragons and Cataclysm Titans!",
				"",
				"&c&lImportant Pack Rules:",
				"&8• &7Industrial Foregoing's Enchantment Factory, Applicator, and Extractor are &c&lremoved&7 to preserve Apothic Enchanting!",
				"&8• &7Industrial Foregoing's Mob Duplicator is &c&lremoved&7 to preserve Apothic Spawners!",
				"",
				"&eUnderstanding the 4 Enchanting Stats:",
				"&8• &aEterna: &7Determines the maximum XP level of the Enchanting Table (up to Level 100!).",
				"&8• &cQuanta: &7Increases random variance around the base Eterna level (can roll much higher—or lower unless rectified!).",
				"&8• &dArcana: &7Guarantees more enchantments per roll and makes rare enchantments common.",
				"&8• &eRectification: &7Blocks negative Quanta variance so your rolls only go UP!"
